WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Trade-offs. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare competing design objectives

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Trade studies compare objectives after hard constraints are satisfied. A preference cannot erase a safety constraint.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Plot mass against cost; keep any required load limit as a boundary, not a score to trade away.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Pareto sort

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A system diagram is a model, not a finished vehicle or proof of roadworthiness.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare competing design objectives
